Windows Hardening and Active Directory Security
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Implement Active Directory security policies using PowerShell automation
Create registry hardening scripts for Windows security configurations
Develop security monitoring and compliance validation tools
Generate security reports and recommendations for enterprise environments
Apply security best practices for Windows and Active Directory environments
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of Windows operating systems and Active Directory concepts
Familiarity with PowerShell scripting and command-line interfaces
Knowledge of security principles and Windows registry structure
Understanding of JSON configuration files
