Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: PowerShell script fails to execute

Solution: Ensure script has execute permissions: chmod +x scripts/*.ps1
Solution: Verify PowerShell is installed: pwsh --version
Issue: Configuration file not found

Solution: Check file path is correct relative to script location
Solution: Verify JSON syntax is valid using: cat configs/ad-config.json | jq
Issue: Log files not being created

Solution: Ensure logs directory exists: mkdir -p logs
Solution: Check write permissions on logs directory: ls -la logs
Issue: JSON parsing errors

Solution: Validate JSON syntax at jsonlint.com
Solution: Check for missing commas or brackets in configuration files
